; Art pass (D102): the Tiny Swords building art is already the size it
; should render at (a 320x256 canvas for a 212 px-diameter footprint,
; landing in the task's own 260-320 px on-screen-width target), so
; Visuals carries no scale of its own any more -- see tower_visuals.gd's
; header for why the old 4x-Kenney-scale note this replaces no longer
; applies. texture_filter is set here, once, and inherited by every child
; left at the CanvasItem default (TEXTURE_FILTER_PARENT_NODE).
